        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Gordon Green, Larry Hagman, Caroline Grace Cassidy\n- Roles: filmmaker, actor, director, producer\n- Works: Your Highness, Dallas, I Dream of Jeannie\n\nFacts:\n- Larry Martin Hagman was born on September 21, 1931, and he was an American film and television actor, director, and producer.\n- David Gordon Green was born on April 9, 1975, and he is an American filmmaker.\n- Larry Hagman was best known for playing J.R. Ewing in the 1980s primetime television soap opera Dallas.\n- Larry Hagman was also best known for playing Major Anthony \"Tony\" Nelson in the 1960s sitcom I Dream of Jeannie.\n- Caroline Grace Cassidy is best known for her role in David Gordon Green's film Your Highness.\n- Larry Martin Hagman died on November 23, 2012.",
